{"title":"2007 BMO","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>2007 BMO</b> problems and solutions. The 24th BMO was held in Rhodes, Greece in 2007.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_BMO_Problems\" title=\"2007 BMO Problems\">2007 BMO Problems</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_BMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 BMO Problems/Problem 1\"> Problem 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_BMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 BMO Problems/Problem 2\"> Problem 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_BMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 BMO Problems/Problem 3\"> Problem 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_BMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 BMO Problems/Problem 4\"> Problem 4</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_BMO&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Balkan_Mathematical_Olympiad\" title=\"Balkan Mathematical Olympiad\">Balkan Mathematical Olympiad</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Balkan_MO_Problems_and_Solutions,_with_authors\" title=\"Balkan MO Problems and Solutions, with authors\">Balkan MO Problems and Solutions, with authors</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competitions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competitions\">Mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competition resources\">Mathematics competition resources</a></li></ul>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colsp